WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Crouching medium punch cancels into Drive Rush.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.800
Forward heavy punch continues the close confirm.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.450
Crouching heavy punch links before Adamant Flame.

4
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:02.850
Heavy Adamant Flame strikes the opponent.

5
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.100
The forward-heavy-punch follow-up launches Ryu away.

6
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.850
Ryu falls at midscreen after the Flame follow-up.
